# Pressing h on a task with no children moves the focus up to its project, so x then completes the project.
file <<END
Trip to Japan:
	- Book flights
	- Reserve hotel
Groceries:
	- Milk
END
keys j j h x
quit
saved <<END
Trip to Japan: @done({today})
	- Book flights
	- Reserve hotel
Groceries:
	- Milk
END
